, <a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The National Map (USGS)</a>.</div><div role="listitem">Houses on streets that end in cul-de-sacs in Carolina Forest, with woods around them and land being cleared for more on the right. U.S. government aerial photo, 2023, by the USDA Farm Service Agency, <a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The National Map (USGS)</a>.</div><div role="listitem">Chapter3 Realty resized these photos and cropped some of them.</div></div></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/invest-where-to-buy/north-myrtle-beach-towers-and-houses-2011-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/invest-where-to-buy/north-myrtle-beach-towers-and-houses-2011-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":675,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"Condo towers and beach houses on the same oceanfront block in North Myrtle Beach","caption":"Condo towers and beach houses on the same oceanfront block in North Myrtle Beach.","description":"Two condo towers, a low condo building and raised beach houses side by side behind the dunes in North Myrtle Beach, seen from over the ocean","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"U.S. Geological Survey"},"creditText":"U.S","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (U.S. Geological Survey)","license":"https://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/","acquireLicensePage":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","isBasedOn":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place