+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-36-100.</span> &quot;Sale&quot; and &quot;purchase&quot;.<br /><br />
+	&quot;Sale&quot; and &quot;purchase&quot; mean any transfer, exchange, or barter, conditional or otherwise, of tangible personal property for a consideration including:<br /><br />
+	(1) a transaction in which possession of tangible personal property is transferred but the seller retains title as security for payment, including installment and credit sales;<br /><br />
