+	(2) tangible personal property to a manufacturer or compounder as an ingredient or component part of the tangible personal property or products manufactured or compounded for sale;<br /><br />
+	(3) tangible personal property used directly in manufacturing, compounding, or processing tangible personal property into products for sale;<br /><br />
